  {
    "index": 9,
    "title": "The training objective",
    "speaker": "Emiel",
    "seconds": 50,
    "notes": "Pose coordinates use Smooth L1. Joint validity uses BCE for missing or irrelevant hands and joints. Exo targets use MSE, and an auxiliary MAE-style decoder reconstructs the third future Ego image. The pose loss weight is 3000. Raw loss scales therefore should not be compared without the weights. All image reconstruction branches serve training.",
