  {
    "index": 10,
    "title": "Evaluation across three benchmarks",
    "speaker": "Emiel",
    "seconds": 65,
    "notes": "AssemblyHands is toy assembly with paired synchronized views. Ego-Exo4D is broader skilled activity with mixed manual and automatic pose annotations. EgoMe-pose is newly pseudo-labeled with InterHand and RootNet and filtered. Metrics: MPJPE is root-aligned joint position error in mm; MPJVE compares joint displacements and is reported in mm. Different fps and label protocols mean absolute errors are not directly comparable across datasets.",
